{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37165","headline":"题光福上方塔 · 顾在熔","name":"题光福上方塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍岛孤生白浪中，倚天高塔势翻空。\n烟凝远岫列寒翠，霜染疎林堕碎红。\n汀沼或栖彭泽雁，楼台深贮洞庭风。\n六时金磬落何处，偏傍芦苇惊钓翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾在熔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}